{"version":1,"content":"<p>萬聖節將至，全城頓時充滿神秘的節日氣氛，大人細路都準備好迎接一連串驚喜！</p><p>這個時候，最適合約埋親朋好友齊齊出動，實行開心吃喝玩樂，盡情釋放日常壓力。</p><p>各大酒店和餐廳已設計好節目和菜式，再加上美酒配搭，客人將自己打扮一番，一於食飽開Party。</p><p>&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:37.531970+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:00:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:02.793818+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:02.793818+00:00","content_hash":"e753e7595e991fb67497915945c1cd5fd91e2c8b117dbddf63493166cae4a987","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}